  "content": "**来看看我的其他资源包！**\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/rainbows-3d-mace\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Op0pojUo/de1eba66a759ae5dd6059c9c5b2fc6fd4b18364f_96.webp\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/rainbows-3d-trident\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/r6fvlh3S/277c6abd5f000a9d49a2beeb71be2eed1cd30e0b_96.webp\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/pyrofish-texturepack\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kmlTU9hm/2165cedac86d3ac045b4b67bd3dcc561eea388a0.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/lava-chicken-vanilla-backport\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Wb9IBuRl/adfa0c4bb37431de52d5f360cab4da5cf9ead673.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n\n\n## 📥 安装方法\n\n放入资源包文件夹并在游戏中启用。\n\n嘿，喜欢炫酷资源包的《我的世界》玩家们！\n隆重推出 Rainbow's 3D Fishing Rod —— 一款完全 3D 化的模型，将原版 2D 钓鱼竿替换为极具立体感和时尚风格的版本。\n![预览图](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a5a8b6ee935f88406e2263745609bbe412b66cd4.png)\n## \n**本资源包允许整合包中使用。**\n\n**即将更新！**\n\n**画廊展示了实际效果，欢迎提供反馈。 <3**",
